 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ig_mdzmKkCwQ7kNvwHwlpw1&_nc_oc=Adq2it5z6c5hdNPa5v0k4ZcfxT1a2OY3IORi54b-UpsTy5NLrvs-0qWCvbwyUFuER8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKZxNdNTCe3QRVBXEmbcUbcJDlYnRZsU_976fKL0rSqSQ&oe=6AA56D41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQA7V6dB__MQ7kNvwHh3dNm&_nc_oc=AdqujfVsRx8gxHQTp4Ies4qrRv82RSDYBijNda9DVgP7GQpLeiQpzlXk5ZU7_jNu8wQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJEdSUmwUFSCJF1svUizBxTJ0KSdTve8ntW_fBGc3U9iQ&oe=6AA54266"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pOSKZU3YaL8Q7kNvwGdZeL3&_nc_oc=AdrVcTflvznEnpRl6c2-ioUwbzOi7ikLD3-jgu4Fn9bMRU8ucmtJwVbEfFxTWsi_iQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLPlhtvTftfvZ_tehilI-CvQD2v4m2GeeKkB8ve60mASg&oe=6AA54C5C"}, {"fil